      <div className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4"><h3 className="font-extrabold text-slate-900">Publish knowledge</h3><p className="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Share ideas and blog-style posts with useful context, topics and discoverable content.</p></div>
